<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Francesco — Radar meteo | Santa Teresa di Riva</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif; background: #020617; color: #f1f5f9; }
    .wrap {
      min-height: 100%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .card {
      width: min(860px, 100%);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .head {
      padding: 18px 18px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
    }
    .head h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; }
    .head p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; }
    .body {
      padding: 18px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9);
      color: #f1f5f9;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .btn.primary { background: #1d4ed8; border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.8); }
    .btn:hover { filter: brightness(1.05); }
    .note {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.35);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    code { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 8px; }
    .footer {
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="head">
        <h1>Francesco / Radar</h1>
        <p>Radar meteo in tutto il mondo — cerca una città e anima il radar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="./santa_teresa_radar.html">
            🌧 Avvia Radar (online)
          </a>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.rainviewer.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Fonte radar: RainViewer
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="note">
          Nota: il radar online usa dati live da internet (RainViewer + Open-Meteo).
          Se vuoi usarlo senza internet, usa l’app offline Pygame:
          <div style="margin-top:8px">
            <div><code>python aggiorna_cache_meteo.py</code> (quando hai internet)</div>
            <div style="margin-top:4px"><code>python santa_teresa_offline.py</code> (poi offline)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <div>Pubblico su GitHub Pages</div>
        <div><a href="https://francescoscandurra11-png.github.io/radar/" style="color:#93c5fd">francescoscandurra11-png.github.io/radar</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

